		(uuid "160dfb0c-2e75-5930-bc17-6ee935e1e999")
	)
	(text "LOW (Bread Modular LOW, no BLAST button): U8B CV follower, R24/R25 halve it, U8A holds the\nLED cathodes at CV/2; CUTOFF rheostat + 330R set the LED current. Two vactrol poles, U6 followers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "27c31897-8eff-5b39-8676-d6002ef71e5c")
	)
	(text "Signal nets are wired; supplies use power symbols. VEL_CV (U2 DAC -> U4B NC2) is joined by its two net labels."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "467b1cec-1208-5d22-acc0-99b8daac9390")
	)
	(text "MIDI IN (TS): 8bit / MIDI V2 NPN front end, pull-ups on +3V3.\nJP1 shipped OPEN: 1-2 = protected (PORT_INVEN on PB3), 2-3 = direct (BM firmware)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9215f87c-5f11-5313-ae87-f6e00141d006")
	)
	(text "MCO MCU: ATtiny1616 at 3.3 V, Bread Modular\nMCO pin map: PB3 RX, PB4/PB5 tones,\nPB0 DETUNE, PA6 velocity DAC.\nPA7 gate, PB2 TX unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a4079ccd-a8a8-536f-8899-72d0e7809da7")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT: C15/R29 AC coupling (1.6 Hz), U9A x3:\n3.3 Vpp -> +/-4.95 V around 0 V, 1k to J4."
